{"4076910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Eldoria", "steam_appid": 4076910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/extras/04af099790434d2ab37214655cc65fe2.avif?t=1783484989\" width=940 height=529 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the truth of darkness in a Souls-like RPG. Face punishing enemies, dig up ancient secrets and Light your way through a mysterious world that challenges every decision.</strong> Explore shifty dungeons with secrets where you least expect them, redeem creatures who have fallen to darkness and use Presence — a heightened state of magical awareness — to reveal secrets you normally wouldn’t perceive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/extras/84f370f5ee6574fc7fc3de4b74d4d3e5.webp?t=1783484989\" width=400 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead of simply slaying corrupted foes, Amara can purify their souls through redemption. Success depends on enemy health and Amara’s Light level, balancing risk and reward. Redeemed enemies regain their true form, thank her, and may leave behind loot or rare Light scrolls — adding moral choice and strategy to combat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/extras/af0c497c83672bf6f0e4831bdab15934.webp?t=1783484989\" width=400 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a heightened magical awareness revealing hidden details in Eldoria — from traps and weakened walls to echoes of past memories. Presence can be used in combat to reveal enemy attack types and weaknesses and even granting time-slowing abilities. Strengthen the power of your Light and your Presence Abilities will rise to match it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/extras/b85cde5ec447de273af5c78abd1c6036.webp?t=1783484989\" width=400 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/extras/ab755456337237860a3f25b473b75ace.poster.avif?t=1783484989\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/extras/ab755456337237860a3f25b473b75ace.webm?t=1783484989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/extras/ab755456337237860a3f25b473b75ace.mp4?t=1783484989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch freely between Magic, Melee, and Archery combat styles. Customize your build by harnessing 12 unique elements — Earth, Fire, Water, Air, Ice, Poison, Electric, Sound, Illusion, Cosmic, Light, and Dark — through spells, infused weapons, and dipped arrows. Elemental strengths and weaknesses mould every fight, so be prepared. Eldoria’s creatures will not go easy on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/extras/c71e4998a3ec32e80b5df9a02d1a6c24.webp?t=1783484989\" width=400 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/extras/e11af2f7db31d20f13b9a1c951068828.poster.avif?t=1783484989\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/extras/e11af2f7db31d20f13b9a1c951068828.webm?t=1783484989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/extras/e11af2f7db31d20f13b9a1c951068828.mp4?t=1783484989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/extras/f52536f43b6cf6b0d0c56128c570d451.poster.avif?t=1783484989\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/extras/f52536f43b6cf6b0d0c56128c570d451.webm?t=1783484989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/extras/f52536f43b6cf6b0d0c56128c570d451.mp4?t=1783484989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse through Eldoria’s landscapes and dungeons filled with traps, surprise enemies, puzzles, and of course, loot! Collect weapons, spell scrolls and potions to survive on your journey. You may, also, discover the oldest truth of all, of why darkness maybe isn’t as scary as it’s cracked up to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Souls-like combat with a focus on mastery, timing, and elemental strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purify corrupted enemies instead of killing them through Redemption</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reveal hidden paths, traps, and memories while in the Presence State</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch seamlessly between Magic, Melee, and Archery combat types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An interconnected world filled with secrets, puzzles, traps and loot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover weapons, spell scrolls, and potions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music: Village Consort Kevin MacLeod </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Licensed under Creative Commons: By Attribution 4.0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/extras/04af099790434d2ab37214655cc65fe2.avif?t=1783484989\" width=940 height=529 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the truth of darkness in a Souls-like RPG. Face punishing enemies, dig up ancient secrets and Light your way through a mysterious world that challenges every decision.</strong> Explore shifty dungeons with secrets where you least expect them, redeem creatures who have fallen to darkness and use Presence — a heightened state of magical awareness — to reveal secrets you normally wouldn’t perceive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/extras/84f370f5ee6574fc7fc3de4b74d4d3e5.webp?t=1783484989\" width=400 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead of simply slaying corrupted foes, Amara can purify their souls through redemption. Success depends on enemy health and Amara’s Light level, balancing risk and reward. Redeemed enemies regain their true form, thank her, and may leave behind loot or rare Light scrolls — adding moral choice and strategy to combat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/extras/af0c497c83672bf6f0e4831bdab15934.webp?t=1783484989\" width=400 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a heightened magical awareness revealing hidden details in Eldoria — from traps and weakened walls to echoes of past memories. Presence can be used in combat to reveal enemy attack types and weaknesses and even granting time-slowing abilities. Strengthen the power of your Light and your Presence Abilities will rise to match it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/extras/b85cde5ec447de273af5c78abd1c6036.webp?t=1783484989\" width=400 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/extras/ab755456337237860a3f25b473b75ace.poster.avif?t=1783484989\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/extras/ab755456337237860a3f25b473b75ace.webm?t=1783484989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/extras/ab755456337237860a3f25b473b75ace.mp4?t=1783484989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch freely between Magic, Melee, and Archery combat styles. Customize your build by harnessing 12 unique elements — Earth, Fire, Water, Air, Ice, Poison, Electric, Sound, Illusion, Cosmic, Light, and Dark — through spells, infused weapons, and dipped arrows. Elemental strengths and weaknesses mould every fight, so be prepared. Eldoria’s creatures will not go easy on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/extras/c71e4998a3ec32e80b5df9a02d1a6c24.webp?t=1783484989\" width=400 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/extras/e11af2f7db31d20f13b9a1c951068828.poster.avif?t=1783484989\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/extras/e11af2f7db31d20f13b9a1c951068828.webm?t=1783484989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/extras/e11af2f7db31d20f13b9a1c951068828.mp4?t=1783484989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/extras/f52536f43b6cf6b0d0c56128c570d451.poster.avif?t=1783484989\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/extras/f52536f43b6cf6b0d0c56128c570d451.webm?t=1783484989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/extras/f52536f43b6cf6b0d0c56128c570d451.mp4?t=1783484989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse through Eldoria’s landscapes and dungeons filled with traps, surprise enemies, puzzles, and of course, loot! Collect weapons, spell scrolls and potions to survive on your journey. You may, also, discover the oldest truth of all, of why darkness maybe isn’t as scary as it’s cracked up to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Souls-like combat with a focus on mastery, timing, and elemental strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purify corrupted enemies instead of killing them through Redemption</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reveal hidden paths, traps, and memories while in the Presence State</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch seamlessly between Magic, Melee, and Archery combat types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An interconnected world filled with secrets, puzzles, traps and loot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover weapons, spell scrolls, and potions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music: Village Consort Kevin MacLeod </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Licensed under Creative Commons: By Attribution 4.0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Eldoria is a Souls-like RPG where beneath Darkness awaits Light. Will you dig deep enough?", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/4fcb3039973a36c384954c42c72d0e23298a34c2/header.jpg?t=1783484989", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/9948f8bac36d6b204d680d854f13d7352ca1cb5f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783484989", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076910/9948f8bac36d6b204d680d854f13d7352ca1cb5f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783484989", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><stron